{"work_id": "MX5-038", "matched_key": "为建设一个伟大的社会主义国家而奋斗", "normalized_offset": 645, "normalized_context": "团体要有一个章程一个国家也要有一个章程宪法就是一个总章程是根本大法用宪法这样一个根本大法的形式把人民民主和社会主义原则固定下来使全国人民有一条清楚的轨道使全国人民感到有一条清楚的明确的和正确的道路可走就可以提高全国人民的积极性我们的总目标是为建设一个伟大的社会主义国家而奋斗大概经过五十年即十个五年计划就像个样子了就同现在大不一样", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "plain_phrase_only", "witness_id": "A-08e901d73dcd78e98c4b", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E5%B9%B4%E8%B0%B1/2023%E5%B9%B4%E7%89%88/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E5%B9%B4%E8%B0%B1_%E7%AC%AC5%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%881953.01-1956.09%EF%BC%89.pdf", "raw_sha256": "ba83874b716e334221fc1105f85530900883ec9430e36a13105ab5886eb22830", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "nianpu-2023-9", "volume": 5, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 256, "end": 256, "record_path": "archive/records/A-08e901d73dcd78e98c4b.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-08e901d73dcd78e98c4b.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东年谱_第5卷（1953.01-1956.09）", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "source_bytes_verified_imprint_images_available_for_review", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "nianpu", "id": "C-8027b8c9350cb5ee", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
