{"work_id": "MX5-038", "matched_key": "为建设一个伟大的社会主义国家而奋斗", "normalized_offset": 391, "normalized_context": "议上的讲话一九五七年三月十二日毛泽东文集第卷第页共产党被人们认为最有纪律最有道德具有最适合人民愿望的路线和政策关于反华问题一九六年三月二十二日建国以来毛泽东文稿第册第页领导我们事业的核心力量是中国共产党指导我们思想的理论基础是马克思列宁主义为建设一个伟大的社会主义国家而奋斗一九五四年九月十五日毛泽东文集第0卷第12页第八编关于党的建设", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "plain_phrase_only", "witness_id": "A-f9feca7a3dc91a159ea9", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/01210805.pdf", "raw_sha256": "807b72378e8aa31733c90aec95d73c092feaa08d651d0a1f8f9db3b6948674e0", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-other", "volume": null, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 1873, "end": 1873, "record_path": "archive/records/A-f9feca7a3dc91a159ea9.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-f9feca7a3dc91a159ea9.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东著作专题摘编", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "other_mia_and_sources", "id": "C-210e7df6fad1117d", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX5-038", "matched_key": "为建设一个伟大的社会主义国家而奋斗", "normalized_offset": 47, "normalized_context": "论人民民主专政一九四九年六月三十日毛泽东选集第版第卷第页指导我们思想的理论基础是马克思列宁主义为建设一个伟大的社会主义国家而奋斗一九五四年九月十五日毛泽东文集第卷第页0马克思主义是无产阶级革命的科学是普遍真理马克思1恩格斯1列宁1斯大林的理论是2放之四海而皆准3的理论不应当把他们的理论当作教条看待而应当看作行动的指南不应当只是学习马克思列宁主义的词句而应当把它当成革命的科学来学习中国共产党在民族战争中的地位一九三八年十月十四日毛泽东选集第版第卷第页马克思列宁主义是从客观实际产生出来又在客观实际中获得了证明的最正确最科学最革命的真理整顿党的作风一九四二年二月一日毛泽东选集第版第卷第5", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-f9feca7a3dc91a159ea9", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/01210805.pdf", "raw_sha256": "807b72378e8aa31733c90aec95d73c092feaa08d651d0a1f8f9db3b6948674e0", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-other", "volume": null, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 1886, "end": 1886, "record_path": "archive/records/A-f9feca7a3dc91a159ea9.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-f9feca7a3dc91a159ea9.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东著作专题摘编", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "other_mia_and_sources", "id": "C-c5c2c62d0e816760", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
